<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - RADIO HEADLINES - JUNE 27.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - RADIO HEADLINES - JUNE 27.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines from Estonia's Kuku radio news report on Friday at noon. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Traffic police want the dismissal of a security police member who was involved in a traffic accident that killed a child cyclist.</p>
<p>- Russian President Boris Yeltsin will ignore the dispute between the Duma and government reformers.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
